    dct:source "Ouchi NB, Glazier JA, Rieu JP, Upadhyaya A, Sawada Y (2003) Physica A 329(3-4):451-458 Eq. (2) (perimeter constraint); perimeter counting convention from Glazier & Graner (1993) Phys. Rev. E 47:2128 Section II (fourth-nearest-neighbour / 8-site interaction range)" ;
